  <section id="storage-config-map" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>Storage and config map</h2>
    <p>
      Config and storage are separate. Config is resolved from well-known remote config, global
      files, custom file env, project files, inline env content, and config directories. Storage is
      durable JSON under <code>Global.Path.data/storage</code> plus SQLite/Drizzle databases under
      <code>Global.Path.data</code>.
    </p>
    <table class="doc-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Need</th><th>File</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Global paths</td><td><code>global/index.ts</code></td><td>XDG/AppData resolution, <code>NIKCLI_DATA_DIR</code>, cache version.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Config loading</td><td><code>config/config.ts</code></td><td>Merge order, plugin/command/agent loading, legacy tools migration.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Config paths</td><td><code>config/paths.ts</code></td><td>Project file discovery, directory list, JSONC substitution.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>TUI config</td><td><code>config/tui.ts</code>, <code>config/tui-schema.ts</code></td><td>Keybinds, scroll, mouse, layout config.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>JSON store</td><td><code>storage/storage.ts</code></td><td>Read/write/update/list/transaction, locks, cache, migrations.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>SQLite</td><td><code>storage/db.ts</code></td><td>Drizzle client, WAL, migrations, PRAGMAs.</td></tr>
