  <section id="tui-map" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>TUI map</h2>
    <p>
      The TUI starts in <code>cli/cmd/tui/thread.ts</code>, creates a worker from
      <code>cli/cmd/tui/worker.ts</code>, then renders <code>cli/cmd/tui/app.tsx</code>. With no
      network options it uses direct RPC fetch and event source. With host/port options it starts a
      real HTTP server and talks through the SDK.
    </p>
    <table class="doc-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Files</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
